{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_title", "source_sha256": "c397db582ecc1f82c1a508d44cdeb1a1c95159d4be45e88ead2d5fb91e7be9dc", "ja": "双星到来☆スウィングバイ！", "zh": "双星到来☆引力加速！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6270d429530bc7333698a4121267bd93d52730892c755e0199b89e3e4d3aa29a", "ja": "サイミン術で眠りに落ちたプロデューサー。\n気が付くとキャプテンアミマミ率いる宇宙船\nに搭乗し、『奴ら』を倒し、シングバイバイ\nして地球に到着。亜美と真美は『わくわく』\nを届けるため、いざセンター公演へ！", "zh": "制作人因催眠术陷入沉睡。\n回过神来，竟已登上了亚美真美舰长率领的宇宙飞船\n，打倒了“那些家伙”，挥歌作别\n抵达了地球。为了传达这份“兴奋雀跃”，\n亚美和真美毅然前往中心公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "d523f5c160241c93f3d42a26513b827afa2fcb5f4f051a1bdf392210c36bee23", "ja": "みんなーっ！　亜美たちのライブ、どうだったー？？\nわくわくしたーー！？", "zh": "大家——！亚美她们的演唱会，感觉怎么样——？？\n有没有让你们兴奋起来——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "778510098f54d511be2e138474ddba513b9d14e108959fab3347fedee0bf982b", "ja": "ワアアァァァァー！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "e8127c54825fb3d996c1c4c55452df9ef7eed80efec369190165fd65089df0c4", "ja": "真美たちも、めーっちゃ、わくわくしたよー！\n宇宙、サイコーー！！　ありがとーー！！", "zh": "真美我们也超级兴奋哦——！\n宇宙最棒啦——！！谢谢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "778510098f54d511be2e138474ddba513b9d14e108959fab3347fedee0bf982b", "ja": "ワアアァァァァー！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bfdffe10538a52246dd766aee23dc445f1216525c652947cc685745018e7a7ef", "ja": "（……亜美と真美のセンター公演は無事成功。\nどうやら、無事に地球は救われたようだ……、ん？）", "zh": "（……亚美和真美的中心公演顺利成功。看来地球也平安得救了……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "903188ffc214074b67ef8659212eb871ef6c240ce57c9429cccb30ee713bfeef", "ja": "兄ちゃん兄ちゃーん！　\n亜美たちのステージどうだった！？", "zh": "哥哥哥哥——！\n我们俩的舞台怎么样！؟", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "01fd16eb68198c02919c1a0f96aef0d217c2a89d18934fff3a871684674bd8bf", "ja": "メッチャすぺーしーだったっしょ！？\n兄ちゃんも宇宙っぽいトコに行けちゃった気分！？", "zh": "超级有宇宙感的吧！？\n哥哥也有种去了宇宙一样的感觉吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4511d0d612f0f7042b007ea84120ab299f06ee95cfe6332dd00f80d2ac2883bb", "ja": "そ、そうだな。本当に、宇宙旅行に行ったような……\n行っていたような……夢をみていたような？", "zh": "是、是啊。真的，就像去了一趟宇宙旅行……\n又好像已经去过了……又好像做了个梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "2c4b7f8e5e9649638fdf5a6692c407c5374589a5dbdcf42b2b5e49d69fc275c2", "ja": "おおっ、そんなにスゴかった？？　やっぱ、みんなで\nレッスンがんばったもんね～！　しかも色々あったし！", "zh": "哦哦，有那么厉害吗？？果然，大家一起努力练习了嘛～！而且还发生了各种各样的事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b96b0cf989773011975824977fb777b5b1fb21988b16d1f9614101a5049411cd", "ja": "ああ、色々あった……はずなんだが……。", "zh": "是啊，确实发生了很多事……应该是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "254ec289a14b70ea687b0e74732f491cb00225ee4991f8f2fe86c4be269358d3", "ja": "亜美ちゃん、真美ちゃん、お疲れさま！\nとっても素敵なステージだったわね♪", "zh": "亚美、真美，辛苦了！\n刚才的舞台真的精彩极了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "bfb20dbb951cdba7f0bff4fa94166fd7485a1fe37b517bb22ca06d5e6b1202d9", "ja": "わ、私も、とっても楽しかったよ！\n本当に、宇宙に飛び立てたみたい……♪", "zh": "我、我也觉得非常开心哦！\n真的就像飞向了宇宙一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "992a8208e296cff6dd7f1da9c98268b0a56a696ecc36b7c734af2403859e97e2", "ja": "えへへっ、あずさお姉ちゃんとしのみやんが、\nレッスンでいっぱい教えてくれたおかげだよ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，这都多亏了阿梓姐姐和诗织酱在训练时教了我好多哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "a1916fceb4b310faa475f86816b39073ef542d7fdc996861f9581b38ad04f07b", "ja": "でも、しのみやん、今日はめっちゃ元気だったよねっ。\nもしかして、レッスンでのアレでふっきれた？？", "zh": "不过，诗织姐姐今天特别有精神呢。\n难道是因为在训练时做了那个，终于想通了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "47210a0d0c7576942d6b1b5af22369ebd02538baafeeaa6df6186340c62ea1fe", "ja": "てへへ……、そ、そうかもしれないね。\nお、思いっきり走り回って、逃げたから……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……也、也许真是这样吧。\n因、因为我拼命四处奔跑，逃掉了嘛……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "54469a1b8d6863cf5a3ec72236b9eea74253814cbbd6982f815e87438b91cd2e", "ja": "ぷぅちゃんも！　アレが出てきたとき面白かったね！\nギター抱えて、もうダメだ～って♪", "zh": "小噗也是！那个出现的时候很有趣吧！  \n抱着吉他说“我不行了～”什么的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "601f6b4e1e8bb0959f4a2c68bff0cff82e873eebce8219871b599dac96873e62", "ja": "面白くないっ！　ったく、ヤなこと思い出させる\nなっつーの。……あと、ぷぅちゃんって言うなっ！", "zh": "一点都不好笑！真是的，别让我想起那些讨厌的事啊。……还有，不许叫我小噗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "fa3d3c0060dfcd61fba3205382af2e5632524340de9ab5f44ccc89b1d49e5b5b", "ja": "まあまあ、アレも真美のジェット噴射でイチコロ\nだったわけだし。とーぶんは安心していいよ♪", "zh": "好啦好啦，反正那家伙也被真美的喷气攻击一下子解决了。暂时可以放心啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1018_p", "source_sha256": "42325ec5f18650569e730cab3a4cf1bf1ce6156123383b238ad02879528d4953", "ja": "うーん……。\nなんか夢の中でも、似たようなことが……？", "zh": "嗯……怎么说呢……\n感觉就连在梦里，也发生过类似的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "fbec30fb5517d54ba3fb394d61f2499d7854b48f5ea853c094e753a898f1a0a1", "ja": "兄ちゃん？\nさっきから、なんかヘンだけど大丈夫？", "zh": "哥哥？\n你从刚才起就有点奇怪，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "1d500af8a66c199cdf22c522adab80364cbd9d69b614f729ee59f682d6c07f04", "ja": "もしかして、まだ真美の必殺技、醒めてない？", "zh": "难不成，真美必杀技的效果还没过去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1021_p", "source_sha256": "89ea8b843b3a75776bb7a01d072459214cf85b97987e06cb69c0afbfea8e83fe", "ja": "え？　……そうか。俺は真美に、\nヘンな催眠術をかけられて……それから……。", "zh": "咦？……这样啊。我被真美施了奇怪的催眠术……然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1022_audience", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c102991473a743582a26c942d02d0d75d42c899e8403c54e5fcfad661838bca5", "ja": "……いや、大丈夫だよ。それに、それどころじゃない。\nみんな待ってる！　さあ、行ってこい！", "zh": "……不，没关系。而且，现在可顾不上这个。\n大家都在等着呢！好了，快去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "5fb6620ade1ef728d76ed22450554131557c20e9368ba6e8f3ccc4d4a2939e42", "ja": "そうそう、兄ちゃん兄ちゃん！", "zh": "对对，哥哥哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1030_p", "source_sha256": "eb68db51d69e8f72e8f93fc88f3f1d1d57d97486c2172dedb6ebd8c0f4e6e418", "ja": "うわっ。どうした、ふたりとも？\nまさかトラブルでも？", "zh": "哇。怎么了，你们两个？\n难道出什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "9fc0003fccf7774c0b79c8ba4e670021e3bce788b7efff5511aa2a0cc8e07f24", "ja": "そうじゃなくてさー。\n亜美たちがあげたアメ、ちゃんと舐めた？", "zh": "不是那样啦——\n亚美她们给的糖，你好好舔了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1032_p", "source_sha256": "9e7910d8a1d42d5e8169f3dcfcdabef2d9a3ff901552a01652bf76278dc4fd8b", "ja": "え？　ふたりがくれたアメって……ん？\nあっ、ポケットに琥珀色のアメが！", "zh": "诶？你们俩给的糖……嗯？\n啊，口袋里有一颗琥珀色的糖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "f28cad68ea26d519f2c8c4da92301591c3b9eb7c19091c25dfe4e11bb4a28bc2", "ja": "やっぱり～！\nもう、ちゃんと舐めなきゃダメだってばー！！", "zh": "果然～！\n真是的，都说了要好好含着才行嘛——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "474e15318d1f6c017ec270c3831af41a5debe48868169c94845ea677579d13a9", "ja": "真美の術にかかってから、ずーっとポヤポヤしてたから\nシャキっとするようにってあげたんだかんね！", "zh": "因为你中了真美的法术后，一直迷迷糊糊的，所以我才给你的，好让你清醒一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_063_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "93bae321c8164ef12423f8ae561799b231ac54364295707ea7a68b0f76e99051", "ja": "口の中でシュワシュワして、頭スッキリするよっ。\n絶対ちゃんと舐めてね！　お願いねっ！", "zh": "在嘴里噼里啪啦地冒泡，脑袋也会变得清醒哦。\n一定要好好含着吃！拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
